    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">Represents
    shares of Common Stock that were automatically added to the shares authorized for issuance under the Amended and Restated 2019 Incentive
    Award Plan on January 1, 2023 and January 1, 2024 pursuant to an &ldquo;evergreen&rdquo; provision contained in the Plan. Pursuant
    to such provision, on January 1st of each year from 2021 through 2029, the number of shares authorized for issuance under the Plan
    is automatically increased by: (a) a number equal to 10% of the total number of shares of Common Stock outstanding (on an as-converted
    basis) on December 31st of the preceding calendar year; or (b) a number determined by the Registrant&rsquo;s board of directors that
    is less than the amount set forth in the foregoing clause (a).</FONT></TD></TR>
